    <string name="credits_title">CREDITS</string>
    <string name="credits_back">BACK</string>
    <string name="credits_intro">Every third-party sound and icon bundled with Pathfinder God is either CC0 (public domain, credited here as a courtesy) or CC BY (attribution required, given here). The CC BY sounds are Tuomo Untinen\'s RPG Sound Pack and tcarisland\'s Inn Music. The CC BY icons are game-icons.net work by Delapouite and Lorc. The navigation icons are Kenney\'s Board Game Icons pack, which is CC0 and credited here as a courtesy. Parchment and felt surfaces are generated procedurally in-repo and are ours. The full registers are kept in the repository at docs/audio-credits.md and docs/asset-credits.md and must travel with any redistribution.</string>
